msgid "relation predicate IRI constraint"
msgstr "关系谓词 IRI 约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RelationPredicateIriConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every supplied relationPredicate value is an actual IRI, including on subjects without a reading type."
msgstr "每个所提供的 relationPredicate 值须为实际 IRI，包括未标注解读类型的主体上的值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RelationPredicateIriConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check the intrinsic consistency of the supplied scoped record."
msgstr "用于检查所提供限定范围记录的内在一致性。"

